 "text": "Outside, the world looks familiar. But everything behaves differently. Cars sit lower on their suspension. Ordinary objects become exhausting to carry. And a fountain that once sent water high into the air might barely reach half its previous height, assuming the water leaves the nozzle at the same speed. Gravity has changed the rules of everyday life.",
